_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s4","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"Figure 1 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s5","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"From epoch 10 to epoch 15, the accuracy of ResNet-18 improves by a relative 6%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s6","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"ResNet-18 scores 4.6 points higher on 15 than on 10.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s7","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"ResNet-18 reaches 72.4% accuracy at epoch 25 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s8","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"At epoch 25, the loss of ResNet-18 is 0.578.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s9","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s10","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"As shown in Figure 2, VGG-16 scores 15.4 points higher on SST-2 than on IMDB.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s11","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"On IMDB, VGG-16 obtains a test accuracy of 51.4% (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s12","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"XGBoost reaches 64.0% accuracy on Yelp.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_027_s13","report_id":"v3feat_027","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null}]}